# PONS $101 — SECURITY, 402 COMPLIANCE & HUMAN GOVERNANCE

PONS $101 is designed as an experimental research system operating around public blockchain infrastructure, token launches, autonomous agents, APIs, wallets, treasury accounting, and reproducibility.

Because those components can touch real assets and irreversible transactions, security is not an optional layer.

Security is part of the experiment.

The governing rule is:

CAN DOES NOT MEAN MAY.

A system may technically be capable of performing an action while still being prohibited from doing so without human authorization.

The PONS $101 security architecture therefore separates:

CAPABILITY

from

AUTHORITY.

Agents may have technical capability.

Humans retain consequential financial authority.

==================================================
SECURITY OBJECTIVE
==================================================

Protect:

• human wallet authority
• experiment integrity
• research provenance
• treasury assets
• API credentials
• contract configuration
• launch manifests
• unsigned payloads
• agent boundaries
• public-good accounting
• reproducibility evidence

while preserving enough transparency for independent review.

==================================================
402
==================================================

402 is the PONS $101 legal, compliance, provenance, credentialing, machine-payment, audit, and release-control layer.

402 is not merely a disclaimer page.

402 is a control architecture.

Its purpose is to ask:

WHO MAY DO WHAT?

UNDER WHICH CONDITIONS?

WITH WHAT EVIDENCE?

WHO APPROVED IT?

WHAT WAS ACTUALLY EXECUTED?

WHAT HAPPENED AFTERWARD?

CAN THE RECORD BE AUDITED?

402 should remain distinct from:

software capability

market prediction

agent recommendation

and

human legal authority.

==================================================
402 RELEASE PRINCIPLE
==================================================

Every consequential action should be evaluated through:

CAN

MAY

SHOULD

DID

PROVED

CAN

Is the system technically capable?

MAY

Is the action permitted under the current governance, permissions, agreements, policy, and applicable law?

SHOULD

Does the human authority believe the action is appropriate?

DID

Was the action actually executed?

PROVED

What evidence establishes what happened?

These states must never be silently collapsed.

