WALLET SECURITY
==================================================

WALLET TYPES SHOULD BE SEPARATED.

RESEARCH WALLET

Used for non-custodial public observation or approved low-risk research interactions.

LAUNCH SIGNER

Human-controlled wallet used for approved launch transactions.

CREATOR FEE WALLET

