==================================================
TREASURY SECURITY
==================================================

Recommended treasury characteristics:

• human-controlled
• multisignature where practical
• documented signer policy
• documented approval threshold
• no autonomous-agent signer
• separate accounting
• transaction-level provenance
• recipient verification
• purpose classification
• periodic reconciliation

An agent may prepare a treasury proposal.

An agent may not independently approve its own proposal.

